# RGB LED colour mixing: cycles red, orange (PWM mix), green, cyan, blue, magenta (PWM mix)
# holding each for 400 ms.
open
# The sketch starts 66 ms after power-on, when the start from reset the fuses set is over.
step 116ms
expect @rgb.red lit
expect @rgb.green off
expect @rgb.blue off
# Orange: red full, green ~50% PWM duty (~5 mA)
step 400ms
expect @rgb.red lit
expect @rgb.green lit
expect @rgb.green.brightness > 4mA
expect @rgb.green.brightness < 6mA
expect @rgb.blue off
# Green
step 400ms
expect @rgb.red off
expect @rgb.green lit
expect @rgb.green.brightness > 9mA
expect @rgb.blue off
# Cyan
step 400ms
expect @rgb.red off
expect @rgb.green lit
expect @rgb.blue lit
# Blue
step 400ms
expect @rgb.red off
expect @rgb.green off
expect @rgb.blue lit
expect @rgb.blue.brightness > 9mA
# Magenta: red full, blue ~50% PWM duty (~5 mA)
step 400ms
expect @rgb.red lit
expect @rgb.green off
expect @rgb.blue lit
expect @rgb.blue.brightness > 4mA
expect @rgb.blue.brightness < 6mA
expect no diagnostics
